  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Lifesaving Assistance and Stabilization Support to Conflict and Drought-Affected Communities in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to support the vulnerable communities in Somalia, affected by conflict and disasters related to natural hazards. Firstly, through increased access to health, nutrition and water, sanitation and hygiene services. Secondly, the project is increasing community resilience to violent extremism through the rehabilitation and community-based reintegration of disengaged women and enabling the Government of Somalia to provide gender-responsive services for women who have disengaged from armed groups and/or are survivors of conflict related sexual violence, thereby promoting human security and foster peace, stability and improved economic conditions of vulnerable people.</narrative>
  </description>
